\begin{lem}
    Let $\{P_1, P_2, \cdots, P_m\}$ be a set of $n$-qubit Pauli operators, and let $n^\prime \geq n$. Then
    \begin{equation}
        \mathrm{STAB}_n(\{P_i\}_{i=1}^{m}) = \mathrm{STAB}_{n^\prime}\big(\{P_i \otimes \mathbb I_{n^\prime-n}\}_{i=1}^{m}\big)\;,
