        |\mathrm{stab}(\mathcal M)| \leq 2^{\min\{n,m\}+\min\{cm,(1/2+o(1))n^2\}}\;,
        \label{eq:upperboundreducedstab}
    \end{equation}
     where $c=\log 3/3$. Without further restrictions on $\mathcal{M}$, this bound is tight and reached by the set of marginals
